                <pb facs="0826" n="716" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg716"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 82.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thomas to
                        Governor Malmboeg, Filipstad.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Stockholm</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 15,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Thanks for your toast to the Chief Magistrate of America, which I gladly forward
                    to the President.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomas.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
